          "lessonId": "p1-b1-l04",
          "reminder": "Zeros divide the number line into intervals on which a polynomial’s sign can be tested."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Test each interval",
      "body": "<p>Choose one point in each interval and find the sign of every factor. Multiply the signs.</p>",
      "recap": "Use a sign chart and retain the endpoints allowed by the original inequality.",
      "pitfall": "The inequality is strict, so check whether a zero can be included.",
      "pause": "Select every positive interval and compare your complete set with the options.",
